# 53. Automated-Trading Maturity Stages and Live Gate

Completing all 15 Agents does not automatically authorize automated trading.

TitanGold automated trading must advance through explicit maturity stages.

## Stage 0 — Specialized Agent Product

- Agent works as a truthful standalone product
- Human QA complete
- No Artemis consumption required

## Stage 1 — Canonical Evidence

- Agent produces the canonical versioned evidence contract
- Evidence is persisted and traceable
- No execution

## Stage 2 — Artemis Advisory

- Artemis consumes compatible evidence
- Produces explainable recommendations
- No orders
- Human reviews decisions

## Stage 3 — Shadow Decisions

- Artemis makes decisions in parallel with the live market
- No orders are sent
- Decisions, gates and outcomes are recorded
- Calibration and conflict handling are evaluated

## Stage 4 — Paper or Simulated Execution

- Full decision chain runs
- Simulated orders and reconciliation
- Risk, sizing, liquidity and failure recovery verified
- No real funds

## Stage 5 — Controlled Sandbox or Limited Test Environment

- Explicit environment authorization
- Minimum permissions
- Bounded operations
- Tier-4 controls where real external effects exist
- Human approval

## Stage 6 — Limited Live Automation

Requires all of:

- Explicit Tier-4 task authorization
- Approved provider and account
- Approved assets and markets
- Approved operation types
- Position and loss limits
- Idempotency
- Risk veto
- Portfolio sizing
- Liquidity validation
- Emergency Stop
- Worker acknowledgement
- Audit
- Reconciliation
- Alerting
- Rollback and incident plan
- Human approval immediately before activation when required

## Stage 7 — Expanded Live Automation

Requires a separate explicit outcome after Stage 6 evidence.

Do not jump stages.

A stage may be rolled back immediately when:

- Data quality degrades
- Calibration fails
- Reconciliation fails
- Runtime provenance is uncertain
- Risk controls fail
- Provider behavior changes
- Audit lineage is incomplete
- Emergency Stop or worker acknowledgement is unreliable

Live mode must fail closed.

No broad Agent Program Slice, Artemis feature, PR merge or green CI check may
implicitly authorize Stage 5, Stage 6 or Stage 7.

